From f0099baaab8ce7562f9a423ad95c040a40b69c54 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhen XIN <lone.zen6@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:04:16 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 03/14] storage: add Ingenic MMC, SPI, SFC and flash support

Port the custom Ingenic MSC and SDHCI drivers, nouveau SPI and SFC controllers, zero-copy spidev, LY68 MTD support, XTX SPI-NOR parts, Winbond NAND support and configurable MTD behavior.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
